# Each Void sees the other's move: Bot1 destroys its own Planar Void with Disenchant while Bot2's Void is out. The Void that
# was destroyed is a card put into a graveyard and so is Disenchant, and Bot2's Void exiles both. Bot2's Void is untouched.

[Bot1 Deck]
Swamp
Planar Void
Mox Pearl
Disenchant
Swamp x3
Swamp x20

[Bot2 Deck]
Mox Jet
Planar Void
Island x5
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Swamp.Play
Bot1.Battlefield.Swamp.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Planar Void.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot2.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot2.Hand.Planar Void.Cast
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Hand.Mox Pearl.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Pearl.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Swamp.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Disenchant.Cast(Bot1.Battlefield.Planar Void)
[T3 Bot1.Main2]

[Expect]
Exile = Planar Void; Disenchant
Bot1.Graveyard.Count = 0
Bot2.Graveyard.Count = 0
Bot1.Battlefield = Swamp; Mox Pearl
Bot2.Battlefield = Mox Jet; Planar Void
